units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300 123456 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix nptfix all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal
thermo 100
run 500000
